src/jdk/data/available_locales.txt and available_time_zones.txt list the
identifiers that OpenJDK 25 reports (CLDR locale identifiers, IANA time zone
database identifiers); src/jdk/data/bmp_decimal_zeros.txt lists Unicode
decimal digit zeros (Unicode Character Database). They were generated by
the oracle harness in tests/fixtures/oracle/ (regenerate.sh).

src/jdk/data/ziggurat_tables.rs holds the numeric values of the tables of
jdk.internal.util.random.RandomSupport.DoubleZigguratTables (OpenJDK 25,
src/java.base/share/classes/jdk/internal/util/random/RandomSupport.java,
tag jdk-25.0.4.1-ga), read by reflection from a running OpenJDK 25 JVM by
the oracle harness in tests/fixtures/oracle/ (ZigguratOracle.java,
regenerate.sh). OpenJDK is Copyright (c) Oracle and/or its affiliates and is
licensed under the GNU General Public License version 2 with the Classpath
Exception (https://openjdk.org/legal/gplv2+ce.html). No OpenJDK source code
is copied; the methods that use the tables are written independently.
